COMPONENT AppPreferences

PURPOSE
    Store ordinary preferences and protected user settings.

PUBLIC VALUES
    reminder timing
    selected theme
    selected AI models
    custom accounting categories
    monthly and yearly budgets
    screen capture preference

PROTECTED VALUES
    AI service credential
    private accounting settings
    screen capture password verifier

READ_PROTECTED_VALUE(name)
    return PRIVATE_SECURITY_IMPLEMENTATION.read(name)

WRITE_PROTECTED_VALUE(name, value)
    PRIVATE_SECURITY_IMPLEMENTATION.write(name, value)

DISABLE_SCREEN_CAPTURE_PROTECTION(password, optional_confirmation)
    validate user input
    create or verify the protected credential
    update the preference after successful verification
    erase temporary password buffers

NOTE
    PRIVATE_SECURITY_IMPLEMENTATION is intentionally omitted from the public repository.
